Derive one reusable tool-recovery procedure from the observed failure and verified correction below. Explain the actual change that enabled success, rather than listing tool descriptions. Preserve failure and successful-read evidence IDs. Do not copy practice filenames, keyword, payload or private paths. Use current task inputs and tool-returned paths in the procedure.
